@startuml 00-system-context
!include ../_style.iuml
left to right direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam ranksep 110
title Nós no Cabo — System context (target)

actor "Visitor" as visitor
actor "Submitter\n(anyone)" as submitter
actor "Site owner" as owner

rectangle "nos-client\nReact SPA\n(Cloudflare Pages)" as spa
rectangle "API gateway\n(Worker, /v1)" as gateway <<new>>
rectangle "Services\ncatalog · moderation · verification\nmetrics · router" as services <<new>>
rectangle "Cloudflare Turnstile\n(bot check)" as turnstile <<external>>
rectangle "Workers AI\n(SFW classification)" as ai <<external>>
rectangle "Member websites\n(optional webring widget)" as members <<external>>

visitor --> spa : browse, filter,\nopen sites
submitter --> spa : submit any site\n(single-page form)
owner --> members : installs widget\n(optional, any time later)
owner --> spa : "Verificar"

spa --> gateway : REST /v1
spa --> turnstile : token on submit
gateway --> services : service bindings
services --> turnstile : validate token
services --> members : scrape metadata,\ncheck widget
services --> ai : classify content
members --> gateway : widget links\n/ring/:id/next|prev|random,\n/r/:code

note right of services
  <b>Community-driven</b>: submissions need no account.
  A site is public only after the SFW check passes.
  <b>Verified</b> = the widget is found on the site;
  verified sites rank first in every list.
end note

@enduml
